User → Wallet: one-to-one
Wallet → Transactions: one-to-many
User → Login history: one-to-many
Login entity → User: many-to-one

User

    id
    username
    password
    Wallet

Wallet
    id
    user_id
    balance
    created_at
    Transaction

Transaction
    id
    wallet_id
    amount
    type
    created_at

Login

    id
    user_id
    login_time


User ↔ Wallet = one-to-one
Wallet ↔ Transactions = one-to-many
User ↔ Login history = one-to-many / many-to-one